*.dSYM/

# Generated kinetics modules and their reaction indices. These are produced for one specific mechanism
# by tools/scripts/chemistry/yaml2nga.py (or pdf_yaml2nga.py) and must never be committed: a mechanism
# checked into an example silently becomes the default and goes stale.
#   python3 tools/scripts/chemistry/yaml2nga.py <mechanism>.yaml <example>/src/chem_data_fc.f90
# For build completeness the examples fall back, through VPATH, to the minimal placeholder module in
# tools/scripts/chemistry/skeleton/ -- that one IS tracked and is the only chem_data_* file in the repo.
**/chem_data_fc.f90
**/chem_data_reactions.txt
**/pdf_mech.f90
**/pdf_mech_reactions.txt
!tools/scripts/chemistry/skeleton/chem_data_fc.f90
!tools/scripts/chemistry/skeleton/chem_data_reactions.txt

